<title>USA: NBA BASKETBALL-FRIDAY'S FIRST ROUND PLAYOFF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NBA BASKETBALL-FRIDAY'S FIRST ROUND PLAYOFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first round NBA</p>
<p>playoff games on Friday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>	    Eastern Conference</p>
<p> Atlanta	    94   DETROIT	   82</p>
<p>(Best-of-five series tied 2-2)</p>
<p>	    Western Conference</p>
<p> LA Lakers	  95   PORTLAND	  91</p>
<p>(Lakers win best-of-five series 3-1)</p>
</text>
